### FAQ entries and groups

### Groups (created on first read: general, ordering, shipping, returns)
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/faq/groups?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

###
POST {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/faq/groups?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

{"key": "account-billing", "names": {"en": "Account & billing"}, "position": 4}

### Create an entry
POST {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/faq?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

{
  "slug": "how-fast-is-next-day-delivery",
  "groupId": 1,
  "keywords": ["delivery time", "shipping", "dispatch"],
  "showInCheckoutHelp": true,
  "translations": [{"language": "en", "title": "How fast is next-day delivery?", "body": "<p>Order before 4pm…</p>"}]
}

### Reorder atomically
PATCH {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/faq/reorder?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

[{"id": 1, "groupId": 1, "position": 0}, {"id": 2, "groupId": 1, "position": 1}]
